---
/**
 * The shared sliding highlight for a `hoverGroup` container. Place it as
 * the first child of the group; items with `data-hover-item` get the pill
 * behind them. Purely decorative.
 */
---

<span
  aria-hidden="true"
  x-bind:style="style"
  x-bind:class="{ 'transition-none': instant }"
  style="opacity:0"
  class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-0 -z-10 rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] transition-[transform,width,height,opacity] duration-200 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
></span>
